                                        "entry_id": "29551ba4-7760-3486-a82c-0b6ee1c43967",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not usual, out of the ordinary."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "52ba6d83-f162-4dc7-af68-36cb7ca2e689",
                                                "sense_id": "8ecbe770-5a51-3e4a-a51c-c4aef568e4b6",
                                                "text": "Every once in a while, though, Idol comes across an unusual talent who just blows everyone away."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e5bb0426-4814-4ccd-a39d-7264b9818804",
                                                "sense_id": "8ecbe770-5a51-3e4a-a51c-c4aef568e4b6",
                                                "text": "It’s definitely not unusual for a couple to meet through friends or be set up on a date."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ef206375-014c-490a-86eb-cea340d53621",
                                                "sense_id": "8ecbe770-5a51-3e4a-a51c-c4aef568e4b6",
                                                "text": "His behavior was unusual in that it was considered childish for a man of his age."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d2e747e-1aa2-4cf0-b884-dcdd4f398899",
                                                "sense_id": "8ecbe770-5a51-3e4a-a51c-c4aef568e4b6",
                                                "text": "I’ve had no problem with female docs. I’ve had some – how should I say it – unusual experiences with a couple of male ones. And I have heard from girlfriends about their unusual experiences as well."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "unusual",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
