                                                "sense_id": "859bc92e-f954-3b9b-a622-d958e55cb2e4",
                                                "text": "I should say that it was very unusual for such men to leave a bottle half empty. How do all these unusuals strike you, Watson?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1cb8de61-8b9d-4f54-9e37-6dbe72a999bf",
                                                "sense_id": "859bc92e-f954-3b9b-a622-d958e55cb2e4",
                                                "text": "Two of these unusuals have been selected for special effort throughout the season. They are kneeling pads and water-proof garden gloves. During the bulb planting season they are displayed with the bulbs […]"
